  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 14.079999923706055px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 246);\">El Museu del Taulell &#39;Manolo Safont&#39; de Onda ha aprovechado que este domingo, 18 de mayo, se celebra el D&iacute;a Internacional de los Museos para inaugurar la tarde del viernes la exposici&oacute;n &#39;Vies, trens i taulells&#39;, dentro de la III Semana Cultural.</span></span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoviestaulellsmuseumanolosafont/img_0394.jpg\" alt=\"img_0394\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoviestaulellsmuseumanolosafont/img_0395.jpg\" alt=\"img_0395\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoviestaulellsmuseumanolosafont/img_0396.jpg\" alt=\"img_0396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoviestaulellsmuseumanolosafont/img_0398.jpg\" alt=\"img_0398\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoviestaulellsmuseumanolosafont/img_0399.jpg\" alt=\"img_0399\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoviestaulellsmuseumanolosafont/img_0401.jpg\" alt=\"img_0401\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoviestaulellsmuseumanolosafont/img_0402.jpg\" alt=\"img_0402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpoviestaulellsmuseumanolosafont/img_0403.jpg\" alt=\"img_0403\" style=\"max-width:100%;height: